        This dialog shows a preview of calendar events using the current template.
        &lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;
        To change the formatting of a calendar\'s events, modify its template, then remove and re-add the calendar.
        &lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;
        Use &lt;b&gt;: -&gt; Add Calendar&lt;/b&gt; (or the main checkbox) to add events to the Android calendar app.
        &lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;
        Use &lt;b&gt;: -&gt; Save Calendar&lt;/b&gt; to save events to an .ics file that can be imported into other calendar apps.
